           - The depositsCount must have increased by exactly 1 because we sent Ether to fallback.
           - If this contract is not the owner, then all owner-only actions must have reverted and
             neither the contract's balance nor this test's balance should have changed due to
             withdraw/withdrawAll/sendMoney (aside from the known fallback sendAmount effect).
